# gil, rank 8, Stage 1, Option kept 1; Malduc completed with Option 1: 1011 (the letter section); _6lg at Stage 1
# without the three quests: 621, Stage 0; at Stage 0: nothing from the mission, the default ITS_LOCKED (8009). Bastok
# Mines: Gumbah 175 (GumbahDialog 1), 177 (Option 0, the letter taken); then Blade of Darkness's 99.
